      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://vi.reeseville.wi.gov/history/"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "During a local boom, Reeseville hosted a variety of businesses, including a glove factory and a pickle factory.",
